# The middens' slot canyons (GenSlots, GEN 34): from above at noon, then on a
# slot floor over the shoulder, turned four ways, walls on both hands.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_slots.tour --seed=1 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_the_middens
wait 3.0
shot slots-above with land:the_middens
place slot_the_middens
wait 2.0
shot slots-floor-above with land:the_middens
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot slots-floor-0 with land:the_middens
mouse 400,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot slots-floor-1 with land:the_middens
mouse 400,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot slots-floor-2 with land:the_middens
mouse 400,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot slots-floor-3 with land:the_middens
